# The Control Center web frontend imports docs/help/**/*.md at build time (Vite ?raw);
# re-include only that subtree so the image build context has it, without un-ignoring all of docs.
!docs/help
!docs/help/**
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy
!deploy/docker/entrypoints
README.md
AGENTS.md
